{"help": "https://dados.recife.pe.gov.br:443/api/3/action/help_show?name=package_show", "success": true, "result": {"author": "Secretaria de Finan\u00e7as", "author_email": "dadosabertos@recife.pe.gov.br", "creator_user_id": "29a76a44-2c7d-4ed1-8a05-fb36e745dccc", "id": "ae32808e-ab98-4fe4-bacf-a72b2ac14551", "isopen": true, "license_id": "odc-odbl", "license_title": "Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL)", "license_url": "http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/odc-odbl", "maintainer": "EMPREL", "maintainer_email": "dadosabertos@recife.pe.gov.br", "metadata_created": "2026-02-27T12:22:30.856240", "metadata_modified": "2026-11-03T02:05:00.759391", "name": "imposto-sobre-transmissao-de-bens-imoveis-itbi", "notes": "O Imposto sobre a Transmiss\u00e3o de Bens Im\u00f3veis (ITBI), pago na compra/venda de im\u00f3veis\r\nOs dados cont\u00e9m a rela\u00e7\u00e3o de transa\u00e7\u00f5es imobili\u00e1rias com recolhimento de ITBI, contendo as  caracter\u00edsticas dos im\u00f3veis e informa\u00e7\u00f5es sobre as opera\u00e7\u00f5es. \r\n", "num_resources": 13, "num_tags": 12, "organization": {"id": "e801642d-d018-4888-9cfc-335e3bc9b5cb", "name": "secretaria-de-financas", "title": "Secretaria de Finan\u00e7as", "type": "organization", "description": "A Secretaria de Finan\u00e7as \u00e9 o \u00f3rg\u00e3o respons\u00e1vel por exercer com efic\u00e1cia e transpar\u00eancia a administra\u00e7\u00e3o dos recursos p\u00fablicos, por meio do lan\u00e7amento, controle, cobran\u00e7a e arrecada\u00e7\u00e3o de tributos e taxas municipais. Administra a \u00e1rea financeira e cont\u00e1bil, no que se refere a pagamento, registro e controle dos atos administrativo-financeiros, gerados pelo Munic\u00edpio e terceiros. A Secretaria tem como miss\u00e3o institucional prover os meios para o financiamento das a\u00e7\u00f5es do Governo Municipal, a partir da arrecada\u00e7\u00e3o, gest\u00e3o e controle de recursos financeiros, visando ao desenvolvimento da cidade e \u00e0 melhoria da qualidade de vida da popula\u00e7\u00e3o.", "image_url": "https://dados.recife.pe.gov.br/base/images/recife/organizacao-financas.png", "created": "2026-02-25T11:46:44.414637", "is_organization": true, "approval_status": "approved", "state": "active"}, "owner_org": "e801642d-d018-4888-9cfc-335e3bc9b5cb", "private": false, "state": "active", "title": "Imposto sobre Transmiss\u00e3o de Bens Im\u00f3veis (ITBI)", "type": "dataset", "url": "", "version": "", "extras": [{"key": "Categoria", "value": ""}, {"key": "Frequ\u00eancia de atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o", "value": "Anual"}], "groups": [{"description": "Dados de Finan\u00e7as P\u00fablicas", "display_name": "Finan\u00e7as", "id": "c4c9b98c-293c-4eff-af8e-78e765da9c86", "image_display_url": "", "name": "financas", "title": "Finan\u00e7as"}, {"description": "T\u00e9cnica de organizar as cidades com o objetivo de criar condi\u00e7\u00f5es satisfat\u00f3rias de vida nos centros urbanos", "display_name": "Urbanismo", "id": "3750cc0b-6973-442a-9485-865362703006", "image_display_url": "", "name": "urbanismo", "title": "Urbanismo"}], "resources": [{"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2026-03-02T15:13:27.109617", "datastore_active": false, "description": "Dicion\u00e1rio de dados do ITBI   Imposto de Transmiss\u00e3o de Bens Im\u00f3veis.", "format": "JSON", "hash": "", "id": "e829c92b-a1b1-47f9-af69-91f584bdc98f", "last_modified": "2026-03-02T15:13:26.979595", "metadata_modified": "2026-03-02T15:13:47.990051", "mimetype": "application/json", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "Dicion\u00e1rio de dados - ITBI", "package_id": "ae32808e-ab98-4fe4-bacf-a72b2ac14551", "position": 0, "resource_type": "file.upload", "size": 5284, "state": "active", "url": "https://dados.recife.pe.gov.br:443/dataset/ae32808e-ab98-4fe4-bacf-a72b2ac14551/resource/e829c92b-a1b1-47f9-af69-91f584bdc98f/download/dicionario-de-dados-itbi.json", "url_type": "upload"}, {"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2026-03-04T1